{"vid":"9rQXNNa2FUg","source":"9rQXNNa2FUg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":10.8,"txt":"There is a flower within my heart Daisy, Daisy"},{"t":21.1,"txt":"Planted one day by a glancing dart Planted by Daisy Bell"},{"t":31.1,"txt":"Whether she loves me or loves me not Sometimes it's hard to tell"},{"t":41.6,"txt":"Yet I am longing to share the lot of beautiful Daisy Bell"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"Daisy, Daisy give me your answer, do I'm half crazy all for the love of you"},{"t":72.2,"txt":"It won't be a stylish marriage I can't afford the carriage"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"But you look sweet on the seat Of a bicycle built for two"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"We will go tandem as man and wife Daisy, Daisy"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"Peddling our way down the road of life I and my Daisy Bell"},{"t":113.7,"txt":"When the road's dark we can both despise P'licemen and lamps as well."},{"t":123.8,"txt":"There are bright lights in those dazzling eyes"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"Of beautiful Daisy Bell Daisy, Daisy give me your answer, do"},{"t":144.8,"txt":"I'm half crazy all for the love of you It won't be a stylish marriage"},{"t":159.7,"txt":"I can't afford the carriage But you look sweet on the seat"},{"t":170.1,"txt":"Of a bicycle built for two I will stand by you in wheel or woe"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"Daisy, Daisy You'll be the bell which I ring you know"},{"t":190.9,"txt":"Sweet little Daisy Bell You'll take the lead in each trip we take"},{"t":201.2,"txt":"And if I don't do well, I will permit you to use the brake"},{"t":211.2,"txt":"My beautiful Daisy Bell Daisy, Daisy give me your answer, do"},{"t":226.8,"txt":"I'm half crazy all for the love of you It won't be a stylish marriage"},{"t":242,"txt":"I can't afford the carriage But you look sweet on the seat"},{"t":252.4,"txt":"Of a bicycle built for two"}],"words":[{"t":10.84,"w":"There"},{"t":10.84,"w":"is"},{"t":10.84,"w":"a"},{"t":10.84,"w":"flower"},{"t":10.84,"w":"within"},{"t":10.84,"w":"my"},{"t":10.84,"w":"heart"},{"t":10.84,"w":"Daisy,"},{"t":10.84